636 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042I am not skeptical at all that a generative model would be able to produce blind spots for us\054 but I am fully skeptical that it would be able to de\055noise that list of blind spots\056\042\n\n\055 Tim)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 637 0 R
     /Pg 620 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
