638 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042I don\047t really want to see the person saying\054 hey\054 ChatGPT\054 here\047s the roadmap that I came up with\056 You now generate the blind spots\056\056\056 you\047re giving it an artifact that is proprietary to Squarespace\054 and you\047re saying analyze this artifact\024that\047s a little bit less okay\056\042\n\n\055 Tim)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 639 0 R
     /Pg 620 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
